   "titulo": "Say a date and invite",
   "texto": [
    "The months are written with a tiny. A date can be written «4. mai» and read «den fjerde mai» («on 4 May»). Bursdag means birthday.",
    "In present, Invitere («invite») passes to Inviteer and does not change according to the person. To thank you, takk for invitasjonen means «Thank you for the invitation.»."
